# Optional. If unset, microtap-mcp auto-generates a wallet on first run and
# stores it at ~/.microtap-mcp/wallet.json — you don't need to set this to get
# started. Set it only if you want to bring your own EVM private key instead
# (e.g. to reuse a wallet you already fund elsewhere).
# MICROTAP_MCP_PRIVATE_KEY=0xyourprivatekeyhere

# Optional. Safety ceiling on any single call's price, in USDC. microtap-mcp
# refuses to auto-pay for anything above this, even if a route's price is
# ever misreported. Default is 0.10 (10 cents) — comfortably above every
# route's real price today ($0.001-$0.05).
# MICROTAP_MCP_MAX_VALUE_USDC=0.10

# Optional. Override the API base URL (mainly useful for local testing
# against a dev server instead of production).
# MICROTAP_BASE_URL=https://x402tap.com
